            "EvidenceStrength": 0.48,
            "IsDiscoveryComplete": true,
            "ClerkNotes": "Shared exhibit. Weak for both sides. The alibi is thin — can\u0027t name the films — but the surveillance footage is somewhat corroborating. The IQ evidence is important context. This is not a strong alibi, but the burden is on the prosecution, not the defense.",
            "MediaType": "Document",
